### Testare Inregistrare (Register)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Adrian",
  "email": "adrian@test.com",
  "password": "parola-secreta"
}

### Testare Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "adrian@test.com",
  "password": "parola-secreta"
}



### 3. Creare Categorie fara Token (Trebuie sa dea EROARE)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tricouri",
  "slug": "tricouri"
}

### 4. Creare Categorie cu Token de Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkzNDg2NzQ4LCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NzMxNDh9.CJd1FAOXtunueMUm5Zh7gyNEaryAV0yYAwZ5Xddsckg

{
  "name": "Geci de Iarna",
  "slug": "geci-de-iarna"
}

### 5. Obtinere toate categoriile (Public)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories



### 6. Creare Produs (Cu Variante - Mărimi și Culori)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkzNDg2NzQ4LCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NzMxNDh9.CJd1FAOXtunueMUm5Zh7gyNEaryAV0yYAwZ5Xddsckg

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "Tricou Polo Clasic",
  "description": "Tricou 100% bumbac, ideal pentru vară.",
  "base_price": 120.00,
  "variants": [
    {
      "size": "M",
      "color": "Albastru",
      "stock": 10,
      "sku": "POLO-ALB-M"
    },
    {
      "size": "L",
      "color": "Albastru",
      "stock": 5,
      "sku": "POLO-ALB-L"
    },
    {
      "size": "M",
      "color": "Negru",
      "stock": 15,
      "sku": "POLO-NEG-M"
    }
  ]
}

### 7. Obținere toate produsele
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### 8. Adăugare produs în Coș (Varianta ID = 1)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkzNDg3OTgwLCJleHAiOjE3OTM1NzQzODB9.YeyLpNetI-MAnnj2Bm8cSKNC4TOTaLNsbZpoh1l-B0Y

{
  "product_variant_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

